Which I'd be happy to discuss with you

358
00:16:28,330 --> 00:16:31,060
一边讨论这个问题
over some peanut brittle in a can.

359
00:16:32,230 --> 00:16:34,790
谢尔顿  我已经没办法了
Okay, Sheldon, I am out of options!

360
00:16:34,790 --> 00:16:37,440
录像带店的老板  勒西斯·曼鲁奇恩
Video store owner, Nursis Manookian,

361
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:39,360
根本就没有直系亲属
has no next of kin!

362
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:42,000
你看起来怒气冲冲的
Well, you seem hot under the collar...

363
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:44,110
是毛衣闹的吗
or is that the sweater?

364
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:45,410
不不
Oh, oh, no, no.

365
00:16:45,410 --> 00:16:47,500
是因为我花了一下午时间
I-It's because I spent all afternoon

366
00:16:47,500 --> 00:16:50,160
去举行他葬礼的亚美尼亚教堂调查
at the Armenian church where his funeral mass was held.

367
00:16:50,160 --> 00:16:51,930
据索拉奇恩神父所说
According to Father Solakian,

368
00:16:51,930 --> 00:16:53,440
没人参加葬礼
no one attended.

369
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:55,430
幸运的是  我跑这趟并不是完全浪费时间
Luckily, my trip wasn't a complete waste.

370
00:16:55,430 --> 00:16:56,990
我点了根蜡烛  祈祷你快死
I lit a candle and prayed for your death.

371
00:16:56,990 --> 00:16:59,620
但我不是亚美尼亚人  所以可能不管用
But I'm not Armenian, so it probably won't work!

372
00:17:01,730 --> 00:17:03,590
这事结束了  对吧
This is over, right?

373
00:17:03,590 --> 00:17:05,600
不一定
Oh, not necessarily.

374
00:17:06,080 --> 00:17:09,180
我建议你去亚美尼亚或是黎巴嫩
I suggest you look for long-lost relatives

375
00:17:09,180 --> 00:17:12,680
找找有没有失联已久的亲戚
either in Armenia or Lebanon.

376
00:17:14,230 --> 00:17:15,880
听好了  谢尔顿
Listen to me, Sheldon.

377
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:17,910
我不会去黎巴嫩
I am not going to Lebanon

378
00:17:17,910 --> 00:17:21,770
还《超级马里奥兄弟》的影碟
to return Super Mario Bros. the movie!

379
00:17:23,370 --> 00:17:25,170
也许很好玩呢
You know, it might be fun.

380
00:17:25,170 --> 00:17:27,490
反正你爱吃鹰嘴豆泥[黎巴嫩特色食品]
You love hummus.

381
00:17:28,710 --> 00:17:30,720
为什么你好像不在意这事呢
Why isn't this bothering you?

382
00:17:30,720 --> 00:17:32,950
你的脑袋里面不痒吗
I-Isn't your brain getting itchy?

383
00:17:32,950 --> 00:17:35,330
这是你的卡借的
This is on your card.

384
00:17:35,330 --> 00:17:37,490
有可能会毁了你的信用记录
This could be ruining your credit score!

385
00:17:37,490 --> 00:17:41,070
为什么这事没让你发疯呢
Why isn't this making you crazy?

386
00:17:42,400 --> 00:17:43,720
莱纳德
Leonard...

387
00:17:45,350 --> 00:17:47,230
我有话跟你说
I have something to tell you,

388
00:17:47,230 --> 00:17:50,330
但我要你保证  不许跳脚
but I want you to promise not to flip out.

389
00:17:50,330 --> 00:17:52,060
什么事
What?

390
00:17:53,520 --> 00:17:55,190
七年前
Seven years ago,

391
00:17:55,190 --> 00:17:57,360
我发现DVD过期未还
I found out the DVD was late

392
00:17:57,360 --> 00:17:59,330
已经付了钱了
and I paid for it.

393
00:18:06,870 --> 00:18:08,170
什么
What?

394
00:18:09,370 --> 00:18:11,190
我当时准备跟你说的
I was going to mention it at the time,

395
00:18:11,190 --> 00:18:13,800
但我想  有一天
but then I thought, some day,

396
00:18:14,710 --> 00:18:17,460
这件事能给你好好上一课
this might be a teachable moment.

397
00:18:41,130 --> 00:18:42,350
我...你...
I... You...

398
00:18:42,350 --> 00:18:43,410
怎么这样
How can...

399
00:18:43,870 --> 00:18:45,570
你是不是人啊
What?!

400
00:18:50,240 --> 00:18:51,580
谢尔顿
Sheldon...

401
00:18:51,580 --> 00:18:53,870
你这样做太恶毒了
that was diabolical.

402
00:18:54,400 --> 00:18:55,680
我知道
I know.

403
00:18:57,190 --> 00:18:58,450
其实我也不容易
And it wasn't easy.

404
00:18:58,450 --> 00:19:01,680
你明白等待多年却不知道
Do you have any idea what it's like to wait for years

405
00:19:01,680 --> 00:19:04,720
能否得到最终的"满足"  有多痛苦吗
and never know if you're going to finally get satisfaction?

406
00:19:13,420 --> 00:19:15,520
你比佩妮形容的还要漂亮
You're even prettier than Penny said.

407
00:19:15,520 --> 00:19:16,930
我不敢相信你这样的女生
I can't believe a girl like you

408
00:19:16,930 --> 00:19:18,300
居然没有男友
doesn't have a boyfriend.

409
00:19:18,300 --> 00:19:19,230
我没有
Well, I don't.

410
00:19:19,230 --> 00:19:21,440
我不相信你  你在骗我
I don't believe you, you're lying to me!

411
00:19:22,610 --> 00:19:23,650
什么
What?

412
00:19:23,650 --> 00:19:24,580
没关系
Oh, it's okay.

413
00:19:24,580 --> 00:19:26,560
我没道德底线  我寂寞到绝望的程度
I have no morals and I'm desperately lonely.

414
00:19:26,560 --> 00:19:27,380
我不介意做小三
I'll be the other man

415
00:19:27,380 --> 00:19:30,060
你要一枝红杏出墙来  我会依着墙角站
if you want a little something-something on the side.

416
00:19:30,810 --> 00:19:32,480
你脑子进水了吗
What is wrong with you?!

417
00:19:32,480 --> 00:19:34,180
你脑子进水了吗
What is wrong with you?!

418
00:19:34,180 --> 00:19:36,250
你脑子进水了吗
What is wrong with you?!

